{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-relics","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigRelic-33146","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-relics-item-ItemConfigRelic-33146-item-ItemConfigRelic-33146-0","text":"出云人借由刀穗将利刃系于腰间。他们行走世间，以刀狩神，又以神骸锻刀…如此循环往复，出云走向繁荣、走向幻灭、走向空无。","speaker":""}]}
